<title>ITALY: Venice air cargo traffic fell by 6.7 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Venice air cargo traffic fell by 6.7 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic at Venice's Marco Polo airport fell by 6.7 percent in June to 1,099 tonnes against the same period of 1996, the airport's managing authority SAVE said.</p>
<p>			  June 97   Pct vs     Jan-June 97  Pct vs</p>
<p>					June 96		     year ago</p>
<p>Cargo (Tonnes)	  1,099   down  6.7	6,858    up  0.1</p>
<p>Aircraft movements    3,664   up    0.5     20,081    up  4.2</p>
<p>Passengers	    284,037   up   13.0  1,371,722    up  9.5</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
